    puts stderr {}
    puts stderr {Protocol buffers are Google's language-neutral, platform-neutral,}
    puts stderr {extensible mechanism for serializing structured data - think XML, but}
    puts stderr {smaller, faster, and simpler. You define how you want your data to be}
    puts stderr {structured once, then you can use special generated source code to}
    puts stderr {easily write and read your structured data to and from a variety of data}
    puts stderr {streams and using a variety of languages.}
}

